#: src/metadata.json
msgid "Gradia Capture"
msgstr "Gradia 截图"

#: src/metadata.json
msgid ""
"Enhances the built-in screenshot tool with annotation features.\n"
"Clipboard data may be overwritten with the annotated screenshot."
msgstr ""
"为内置截图工具增强标注功能。\n"
"剪贴板数据可能被带标注的截图覆盖。"

